# Opposing worlds for every timing gap

Version `0.1.0`. Status: `exploratory`. 18 September 2026.

All seven bound gaps in the [timing study](../../reference-timing/0.1.0/README.md)
now have independently checked geometric worlds on both sides of the strict
replacement decision. Every one of its 57 unresolved case/contract rows has
that evidence. The 63 supported, 91 excluded and 81 input-blocked rows are
unchanged. These are overlapping, conditional development cases, not customer
decisions or evidence of savings.

