Values are mean old loss minus new loss, with unit false-positive and miss
penalties. A positive value supports strict improvement in that world. The
primary 64-image current-partial case remains unresolved: universal bounds
[-43/64, 99/64], now with attained worlds -27/64 and 73/64. Its previous worlds
-21/64 and 61/64 remain retained. The strict and union full-population cases
remain blocked; a missing preceding census is never an empty census.

## What changed

The [separately frozen plan](PLAN.md) selects all seven known gaps, yielding
14 image/contract pairs across 12 images. Four zero-unknown pairs are inherited
exactly. The other ten pairs use eight finite geometric pools: every threshold
point and open cell along whole-canvas axis sweeps of declared fixed shapes.
Identical neighborhoods are collapsed without forbidding repeated geometry for
different unknown instances. A bounded multiset search preserves intermediate
worlds even when they do not immediately improve either matching difference.

The construction covers 348 bases, 10,574 axis cells, 6,917 unique rectangles
and 110 nonempty matching neighborhoods across the eight images. All ten
searched pairs attain both universal endpoints after 366 distinct conventional
flow measurements. No construction, evaluation or reference cap is reached.
Attainment establishes these selected endpoints without claiming exhaustive
search over all arbitrary rectangles. The source model and uncertainty family
are unchanged. A better selector cannot remove this demonstrated ambiguity.

## Checks and retained costs

The 176-binding freeze precedes new refined scores. All 21 synthetic controls
pass, including 96 exhaustive tiny multiset comparisons, narrow threshold
regions, repeated neighborhoods, neutral intermediate worlds, resource limits
and deliberately corrupted records. A separate piecewise-overlap construction
checks the pool; independent exact geometry, augmenting-path matching and
native certificate checks verify retained worlds. All 292 rows and 132 native
proofs, including inherited proofs, verify. This is internal verification,
not independent scientific replication.

Analysis takes 2.390407041 process seconds and verification 2.771332125.
These are measured command costs, not end-to-end work, human savings or an
equivalent-work speed comparison. See [cost scope](COSTS.md),
[all case rows](results.csv), [all target components](components.csv) and
[summary identities](summary.json). There were no failed actual searches.

This adaptive follow-up does not turn the motion model into corrected truth,
cover objects outside both annotation censuses, establish an annotation error
rate, or measure operational safety. All 1,433 reserved images remain closed.
No image reads, model calls, downloads or training occur. Earlier parity,
query floors and negative value findings remain intact.

Source custody and derived-report terms are retained in [SOURCES.md](SOURCES.md)
and [DISTRIBUTION.md](DISTRIBUTION.md). Authored code and synthetic controls use
Apache-2.0; the data-derived reports retain nuScenes source conditions.
